Package: libenchant-2-2
Version: @DEB_ENCHANT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://abiword.github.io/enchant/
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: Generic spell-checking library - runtime
 Enchant provides a uniform interface to spell-checking backends. This package
 contains the shared library and the enchant-2 tool. No dictionary backend is
 bundled, so spell-checking is inert until a provider (hunspell/aspell) is added.
